test suite using `pytest` and ensure their code passes `ruff`, which is 
configured as both the linter and the formatter. All changes will be validated 
through GitHub Actions workflows, so automated checks will run on any pull 
request. Because `ruff` is explicitly set up, you should let it handle code 
style rather than trying to match formatting by hand.

